{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0129jCLarVuwTwYMdhBKyEd3","type":"tool_result","content":"def _hint(answer_id):\n    tail = re.sub(r\"^(?:set|slot)[._-]?\\d+[._-]\", \"\", answer_id).split(\".\")[-1]\n    return re.split(r\"-(?:magic|sha256|sha1|md5|size|filename|text|d\\d\\d)\\b\", tail)[0]\n\n\ndef local_answer(answer_id, question, data, contract):\n    \"\"\"TODAY's new field (the worker adds it here; None = not today's). Derive it from `data`; never hard-code.\"\"\"\n    sm = re.search(r\"synthesis-(md5|sha1|sha256|sha512)-order$\", answer_id.lower())\n    if sm:   # D15+ synthesis: the `Files: [...]` siblings of the artifact's own container, ordered by digest\n        if _ROOT is None:\n            return None\n        from lib.meta.synthesis import digest_order\n        container = ((question or {}).get(\"artifact\") or \"\").partition(\"->\")[0].strip()\n        return digest_order(question, lambda n: artifact_bytes(\n            _ROOT, contract, f\"{container} -> {n}\" if container else n, n), sm.group(1))\n    return None\n\n\ndef answer(answer_id, question, data, contract):\n    v = local_answer(answer_id, question, data, contract)\n    if v is not None:\n        return v\n    v, _tier = meta.answer(answer_id, question, data)\n    return v\n\n\n1:\"\"\"`media` primary VIDEO stream geometry fields (aliases `video`, `av`) -- prebuilt, SPECULATIVE.\n2:\n3:Spelling follows ffprobe -show_streams on the FIRST video stream (container stream order):\n4:  - width / height: coded size from the container (MP4 stsd visual entry, Matroska Video/PixelWidth|PixelHeight,\n5:    AVI strf BITMAPINFOHEADER biWidth/|biHeight|), NOT rotated (ffprobe keeps the coded size; rotation is side data).\n6:  - frame_rate: ffprobe r_frame_rate \"num/den\" reduced. MP4 = mdhd timescale / dominant stts delta; Matroska =\n7:    1e9 / DefaultDuration snapped to the NTSC/integer rates ffprobe guesses (59.94006 -> 60000/1001); AVI = strh\n8:    dwRate/dwScale.\n9:  - pix_fmt: avcC high-profile tail / SPS chroma_format_idc + bit depth, hvcC chromaFormat/bitDepthLuma, vpcC (Matroska\n10:    CodecPrivate features for VP9), av1C flags, MJPEG first-frame SOF sampling (yuvj*), mpeg4 -> yuv420p, ProRes\n11:    apc* -> yuv422p10le / ap4* -> yuv444p10le.\n12:  - profile: ffprobe profile names (\"High\", \"Constrained Baseline\", \"Main 10\", \"Profile 1\", \"Simple Profile\",\n13:    \"Standard\"); level = ffprobe int (h264 level_idc, hevc general_level_idc, av1 seq_level_idx).\n14:  - rotation: ffprobe displaymatrix \"rotation\" = -atan2(b, a) of the tkhd matrix, a signed int (a phone-portrait\n15:    matrix [0 1 -1 0] -> -90; 180 -> -180); no matrix / identity -> 0. `rotate` = the legacy clockwise tag\n16:    (exiftool / mediainfo Rotation: 0..359, same matrix -> 90).\n17:  - codec_tag_string / codec_tag: the stsd fourcc / AVI biCompression, ffprobe hex \"0x31637661\"; Matroska has none\n18:    (\"[0][0][0][0]\" / 0x00000000 in ffprobe).\n19:A member that is not audio/video -> \"none\"; audio-only media -> \"none\"; unreadable media -> None.\"\"\"\n20:import math\n21:import struct\n22:\n23:from ..spell import Dims\n24:\n25:FIELDS = {\n26:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_width\"): \"video_value\",\n27:    (\"media\", \"video_width\"): \"video_value\",\n28:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_stream_width\"): \"video_value\",\n29:    (\"media\", \"first_video_width\"): \"video_value\",\n30:    (\"media\", \"video_stream_width\"): \"video_value\",\n31:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_height\"): \"video_value\",\n32:    (\"media\", \"video_height\"): \"video_value\",\n33:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_stream_height\"): \"video_value\",\n34:    (\"media\", \"first_video_height\"): \"video_value\",\n35:    (\"media\", \"video_stream_height\"): \"video_value\",\n36:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_dimensions_pixels\"): \"video_value\",\n37:    (\"media\", \"primary_video_dimensions\"): \"video_value\",\n38:    (\"media\", \"video_dim